OL,3,GNEWSA'We are not the undeserving poor
OL,4,Aof the Victorian era'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA teenager who went into care when he
OL,7,Fwas 10 has described how he struggled
OL,8,Fto navigate the system and seek help.
OL,10,FHayden, now aged 17, lived in a
OL,11,Fchildren's home until he was 16 before
OL,12,Fmoving into a semi-independent home.
OL,13,FAfter feeling unsafe there he ended up
OL,14,Fsofa-surfing.
OL,16,F"There is an incredible amount of
OL,17,Findividuals working so hard to improve
OL,18,Fthe lives of young people but the
OL,19,Fsystem is fundamentally flawed," said
OL,20,FHayden, who got in touch with the BBC
OL,21,Fvia Your Voice to share his experience.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
