OL,3,GNEWSA'We are not the undeserving poor
OL,4,Aof the Victorian era'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA new government-commissioned report
OL,7,Ffound that young adult care-leavers
OL,8,Fhave a death rate about four times
OL,9,Fhigher than the general population.
